85 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H4/P 59 0 R/T(The commercial mobilization of the precious metal owned by Mr. Fernando Manoel Bizarra is strictly initiated by Brink's Global Services \(Ghana\). Acting as the accredited security logistics operator, Brink\220s assumes full execution-only liability at the point of origin in Accra, issuing the initial tracking code denominated as the House Air Waybill Number \(HAWB Code: BRK-GH-ACC- 2026-9912\). This cryptographic tracking registry functions as the sovereign security baseline of the asset during international transit. Brink\220s clears the raw dor\351 gold bars through the Customs Division of the Ghana Revenue Authority \(GRA\) and the Precious Minerals Marketing Company \(PMMC\) under an official unified export permit, cross-referencing the HAWB Code with the national mineral royalties and statutory export compliance frameworks. Covered by an ad valorem All-Risk Global Insurance Policy underwritten by Lloyd's of London, Brink\220s executes the armored secure airlift directly to the Valcambi refinery in Balerna, Switzerland, for independent assaying, smelting, and metallurgical transformation to Good Delivery standards. Upon the refinery casting the gold into standard London Good Delivery bars, Brink\220s issues a certified Customs Entry Manifest, maintaining an unbroken HAWB tracking chain through secure transit corridors.)/E(The commercial mobilization of the precious metal owned by Mr. Fernando Manoel Bizarra is strictly initiated by Brink's Global Services \(Ghana\). Acting as the accredited security logistics operator, Brink\220s assumes full execution-only liability at the point of origin in Accra, issuing the initial tracking code denominated as the House Air Waybill Number \(HAWB Code: BRK-GH-ACC- 2026-9912\). This cryptographic tracking registry functions as the sovereign security baseline of the asset during international transit. Brink\220s clears the raw dor\351 gold bars through the Customs Division of the Ghana Revenue Authority \(GRA\) and the Precious Minerals Marketing Company \(PMMC\) under an official unified export permit, cross-referencing the HAWB Code with the national mineral royalties and statutory export compliance frameworks. Covered by an ad valorem All-Risk Global Insurance Policy underwritten by Lloyd's of London, Brink\220s executes the armored secure airlift directly to the Valcambi refinery in Balerna, Switzerland, for independent assaying, smelting, and metallurgical transformation to Good Delivery standards. Upon the refinery casting the gold into standard London Good Delivery bars, Brink\220s issues a certified Customs Entry Manifest, maintaining an unbroken HAWB tracking chain through secure transit corridors.)/Pg 8 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

86 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 59 0 R/T(THE LONDON BULLION MARKET COMPLIANCE AND VAULT INTEGRATION)/E(THE LONDON BULLION MARKET COMPLIANCE AND VAULT INTEGRATION)/Pg 8 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

87 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H4/P 59 0 R/T(The refined bullion lot is systematically integrated into the institutional custody network under strict London Bullion Market Association \(LBMA\) compliance protocols. The secure logistics framework ensures seamless chain-of-custody transfer from Valcambi SA to designated institutional depository accounts, validating absolute legitimacy, ethical provenance, and comprehensive anti-money laundering \(AML\) compliance pursuant to international regulatory standards.)/E(The refined bullion lot is systematically integrated into the institutional custody network under strict London Bullion Market Association \(LBMA\) compliance protocols. The secure logistics framework ensures seamless chain-of-custody transfer from Valcambi SA to designated institutional depository accounts, validating absolute legitimacy, ethical provenance, and comprehensive anti-money laundering \(AML\) compliance pursuant to international regulatory standards.)/Pg 8 0 R/K[9]>>
